    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2026 revenue rose 17.3% to $67.4 billion on a $9.3 billion increase in cloud and software revenues as customers purchased applications and infrastructure technologies and renewed cloud contracts [D421][F10][P17]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "drivers", "title": "What drove growth", "sentences": [
