    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Net margin of 25.2% sat 5.4pp below the 30.6% operating margin in FY2026, as interest expense of $4.6 billion and a 28.4% tax rate pulled it down [F54][F34][D832][X92][D407]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
