    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Net debt reached $97.6 billion in FY2026, net cash of -145.0% of revenue against a -0.5% software peer median, the 0th percentile of six peers [D414][D415][D816][D815]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Total debt rose 39.9% to $129.5 billion, primarily due to $42.7 billion of senior notes issued in FY2026 [D440][D413][P7]."},
